invalid type: string "Scheme Name: Hdfc Mid Cap Fund Direct Growth\nWhat is the PE and PB ratio of HDFC Mid Cap Fund Direct Growth?\nThe\nPE ratio\nratio of HDFC Mid Cap Fund Direct Growth is determined by dividing the market price by\n its earnings per share and the\nPB ratio\nof the same is evaluated by dividing the stock price per share by its book value\n per share (BVPS).\nrance.\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ